---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftInstructionRelease
---
Construct a InstructionRelease draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Obtain qualified review of the exact variant, publish controlled copies, and coordinate acknowledgment or training. Retire outdated copies without erasing historical execution records and re-evaluate affected instructions when equipment or master procedures change.
